 {
  "resourceId": "gid://shopify/OnlineStoreThemeJsonTemplate/product?theme_id=165809488115",
  "translatableContent": [
   {
    "key": "section.product.json.main.composition_care.heading:g5ptzhx1h7v3",
    "value": "Composition & care",
    "digest": "cbb5d0ab9082bd8edd17c549a77404442d852e89fe8c233e4001db0e9f6e2575"
   },
   {
    "key": "section.product.json.main.composition_care.content:g5q09dcz2tqm",
    "value": "<p>Each piece is made from natural materials chosen for how they age with use. The exact composition is listed in the description above.</p><ul><li>Follow the care label sewn into each piece; most prefer airing over washing.</li><li>Dry flat, away from direct heat and sunlight, and press with a cool iron.</li><li>Store knitwear folded; hang tailoring and outerwear on a shaped hanger.</li></ul>",
    "digest": "217f83f932ebf99a4f72497ee367b60760da9da603a54c510624ce9e62e1512b"
   },
   {
    "key": "section.product.json.main.shipping_returns.heading:1rflao3u1295",
    "value": "Shipping & complimentary returns",
    "digest": "346b529e8d8411c669ad20ee6f54b52030b93da75509e496c15f501e489fc188"
   },
   {
    "key": "section.product.json.main.shipping_returns.content:1rfpmuyxl5m0",
    "value": "<p>Pieces held in the atelier leave within three business days, with tracking. Shipping is complimentary on orders over $150.</p><p>Returns are complimentary within fourteen days of delivery for unworn pieces with their tags in place. Made-to-order work is final sale.</p>",
    "digest": "fb7913b7377decd273663509dadf3ba16d8cd11ae3f5cffa90915ae7be163451"
   },
   {
